00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:22.110
over this thing, called a blockchain.

00:05:22.110 --> 00:05:24.970
And you know, so, to
me, this is a forever.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.860
Now, the more interesting part

00:05:28.142 --> 00:05:30.970
- [Eric] Yes
- in both '95 and 2005

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:33.270
I saw every project

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:35.380
