00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.410
And that was hard.

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:41.920
It was hard to raise capital

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:43.130
and start a meaningful business

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:44.310
on top of these platforms.

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:47.010
NFT's are easy.

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:49.530
The ability after you learn a little bit,

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:52.880
to mint and put on a
marketplace, anything?

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:55.870
I sold a tweet for
$2,000 right now on Cent.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:56.703
this is real now,
- [Eric] Yeah.

00:05:56.703 --> 00:05:58.070
- because I want to
earn and what have you,

00:05:58.070 --> 00:05:59.770
