00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.310
I just thought of myself as a

00:07:51.310 --> 00:07:52.210
businessman
- You do?

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:53.077
You have the gift of gab?

00:07:53.077 --> 00:07:54.980
- Just a little something.
(Eric laughing)

00:07:54.980 --> 00:07:56.460
- So Eric, here's what I would say,

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:57.360
in the macro,

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:59.490
it's one of the biggest technology shifts

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:02.160
