00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:16.540
On the flip side, the same way in March

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:17.373
and April of 2000,

00:08:17.373 --> 00:08:21.140
Amazon was the, literally the only stock

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:24.490
