00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:34.143
Everything's going to zero.

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:36.840
Amazon's going to win.

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:38.210
Even then I knew it,

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:40.320
and so, I did very well.

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:41.960
I think the same way is

00:08:41.960 --> 00:08:43.500
that's what I'm trying to do now.

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:46.450
Which NFT projects,

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:48.880
whether it's people, whether it's punks,

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:51.540
whether it's hashmasks,
whether it's Kiddies,

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:53.250
whether it's, you know,

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:57.060
3lau, you know, like what,

00:08:57.060 --> 00:08:59.830
